    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following code shows an example of applying three polynomials to an [`vImage.Interleaved8x3`](vimage/interleaved8x3.md) buffer:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following code shows an example of applying three polynomials to an [`vImage.Interleaved8x3`](vimage/interleaved8x3.md) buffer:",
      "sourceHash": "b9c0f771b064011fe8091f59aec95e1499f7c01dd7d29fda814316440bb7e932",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet src = vImage.PixelBuffer<vImage.Interleaved8x4>(\n    pixelValues: [64, 128, 192, 255],\n    size: vImage.Size(width: 1, height: 1))\n\nlet dest = vImage.PixelBuffer<vImage.InterleavedFx4>(\n    size: src.size)\n\nsrc.applyPolynomial(coefficientSegments: [ [1, 0, 0],\n                                           [0, 1, 0],\n                                           [0, 0, 1] ],\n                    boundaries: [0, 1/3, 2/3, 1] as [Float],\n                    destination: dest)\n\n// Prints:\n//  1.0         ≅ 1 * (64 / 255)⁰\n\n//  0.5019608   ≅ 1 * (128 / 255)¹\n\n//  0.56692046  ≅ 1 * (192 / 255)²\n//  1.0         ≅ 1 * (255 / 255)²\nprint(dest.array)\n```",
      "documentTitle": "applyPolynomial(coefficientSegments:boundaries:destination:)",
      "framework": "Accelerate",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
